Package: zfstool
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, libgtk-3-0, zfsutils-linux
Recommends: smartmontools
Description: read-only ZFS and host inspection tool (agent, web UI, GUI)
 zfstool runs a small agent that exposes pool and host data over a Unix
 socket (HTTP). The web and gui commands provide a browser UI. A systemd
 unit is included for the agent (zfstool-agent.service).
